<block wx:if="{{live}}"><view class="page live-settings"><view class="title">修改书名</view><view class="section">修改项目展示书名，当前故事版本和本人决定可在项目页核对。</view><input class="live-title section" value="{{title}}" data-field="title" bindinput="input" maxlength="80" disabled="{{busy || !overview}}" /><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error section">{{error}}</view><button wx:if="{{!overview}}" class="btn secondary section" bindtap="onShow" disabled="{{busy}}">重新查询</button><button class="btn section" bindtap="save" disabled="{{busy || !overview}}">{{busy?'正在保存…':'保存书名'}}</button></view></block>
<block wx:else="">
<view class="page with-dock"
  ><view class="title">给故事，一个名字</view
  ><view class="subtitle">现在不用想得很完整，之后还可以修改。</view
  ><view class="field section"
    ><text class="label">这本书的主人公</text
    ><view class="soft">{{recipient}}</view></view
  ><view class="field"
    ><text class="label">书名</text
    ><input
      value="{{title}}"
      bindinput="input"
      data-field="title"
      maxlength="20" /></view
  ><view class="field"
    ><text class="label">赠礼人称呼</text
    ><input
      value="{{buyer}}"
      bindinput="input"
      data-field="buyer"
      maxlength="20" /></view
  ><view class="note section"
    >修改书名后，需要重新确认书稿。展示的成书图片为效果示意，实际书封以最终预览为准。</view
  ><view class="error">{{error}}</view></view
><view class="dock"><button class="btn" bindtap="save">保存资料</button></view>
</block>
